# 存盘进行到一半时退出：存档任务第一次写前停 2.5 秒，这时走系统退出；退出等到这次存盘提交了再走，存档合法
# Quitting in the middle of a save: the save job pauses 2.5 s before its first write, and the system quit comes during that pause; the quit waits for this save to commit before going, and the save is valid
name save_delay_quit
requires cli mac-app
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
stick 0 1 frames=30
fault delay ms=2500
save_now wait=0
sleep 0.5
system_quit
check event fault point=savedelay
check event quit_save saved=true
check exit 0
check saved
check no_event save_stuck
